The core software logic, database architecture schemas, and mathematical policy modeling contained within this repository—specifically including the **Secure Physician-to-DMV Vision Pipeline API Simulation** and the **AHEAD Regional Actuarial Budgeting Engine**—represent original civic engineering frameworks developed by **usginger (The People's Congress)**.

